// Title: Use Short Name Path in Command Line
// Rule ID: 349d891d-fef0-4fe4-bc53-eee623a15969
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1564.004, detection.threat-hunting
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules-threat-hunting/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_ntfs_short_name_path_use_cli.yml
